#: ../../../topics/download-handlers.rst:220
msgid ""
"Bad header handling is what a handler does when a response has a bad header "
"line, e.g. one with no colon in it, which some servers send. Handlers that "
"skip bad header lines, like web browsers do, still parse the header lines "
"that follow them; other handlers also lose those, or cannot download such "
"responses at all."
