"IPv6 address literals such as ``https://[::1]/``, with the resolver set in :"
"setting:`TWISTED_DNS_RESOLVER`, whose default value only supports IPv4. To "
"use IPv6 with them, set it to ``scrapy.resolver.CachingHostnameResolver``."
